22:34:52 [5546] Practise these target speech sounds by naturally featuring words that contain them (do not turn the story into a pronunciation drill):
22:34:52 [5546] - advanced sounds [th, r, ch] (Late-developing speech sounds for articulation practice.): e.g. thumb, three, rabbit, red, chair, cheese
22:34:52 [5546] 
22:34:52 [5546] Use these interest themes as story hooks, characters, and settings:
